# Keep the Docker build context lean and free of source-control / dev residue.
# The Dockerfile COPYs only package manifests, .vendor, src and fixtures, but a
# trimmed context also speeds the build and keeps boot-check hygiene guarantees.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
web
workforce-control
test
docs
coverage
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.DS_Store
# Vendored @aion/core is REQUIRED in the context (Dockerfile: COPY .vendor .vendor)
# and is produced by `npm run setup:core` before the build — do not ignore it.
